'''Casaurian Darkjo''' (超闇獣ダックジョー, ''Chō Anjū Dakkujō'', '''Super Dark Beast Dakkujō''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]].

