==Trivia==
*"Casaurian" is a portmanteau of ''[[wikipedia:Cassowary|Casuarius]]'', the genus of birds that cassowaries are in, and ''saurian'', meaning "of or like a lizard".
*Darkjo's Japanese name, Dakkujō (ダックジョー), is a pun: ダック ''dakku'' means duck, but also sounds similar to ダーク ''dāku'' (dark).
*Casaurian Darkjo can be considered the [[wikia:monsterhunter:Yian Garuga|Yian Garuga]] to [[Casaurian Ahirujo]]'s [[wikia:monsterhunter:Yian Kut-Ku|Yian Kut-Ku]]. His Toxic ability is a reference to Yian Garuga's poisonous tail, and his red eye is the same color as [[wikia:monsterhunter:Deadeye Yian Garuga|Deadeye Yian Garuga]]'s.
**Since Yian Kut-Ku's title is Strange Bird (怪鳥 ''Kaichō''), Ahirujo is likely one of the three Strange Bird Brothers (怪鳥三兄弟 ''Kaichō Sankyōdai'') mentioned in Darkjo's Japanese description. The literal translation of 怪鳥 is "strange bird", but it usually refers to a supernatural or monstrous bird, which removes the possibility of [[Duche]] being one of the brothers.
***Furthermore, [[Ancient Magamojoe]] is implied to be their father.
*Many black ducks exist in real life, such as the [[wikipedia:African black duck|African black duck]], [[wikipedia:American black duck|American black duck]], [[wikipedia:Harlequin duck|harlequin duck]], [[wikipedia:Muscovy duck|Muscovy duck]], [[wikipedia:Paradise shelduck|paradise shelduck]] and all sea ducks in the genus ''[[wikipedia:Scoter|Melanitta]]''.
**Darkjo's red eye is also reminiscent of the [[wikipedia:Red-breasted merganser|red-breasted merganser]] and the [[wikipedia:American coot|American coot]], the latter not actually being a duck, but frequently mistaken for one.
*Although Casaurian Ahirujo, Casaurian Darkjo and Ancient Magamojoe all have ジョー ''jō'' in their Japanese names, it was romanized inconsistently in English: "jo" for the Casaurians, "joe" for Magamojoe.
*His English description has a typo. It says "can fell and foe" instead of "can fell ''any'' foe".
*In the main [[Legend Stages]], Casaurian Darkjo is introduced before Casaurian Ahirujo.
*He and [[Oldstrich]] are the only enemies with a non-guaranteed [[Toxic]] ability.
**Darkjo was the first enemy introduced to have a non-guaranteed [[Toxic]] ability.

